<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  KOMSA test run settings.

  Excludes the tests that require Ghostscript and ImageMagick (BUILDING.md: the
  ITEXT_GS_EXEC / ITEXT_MAGICK_COMPARE_EXEC environment variables). Those tools are
  not installed in the KOMSA environment and the visual-comparison tests are not
  relevant for this fork.

  Use in Visual Studio via  Test > Configure Run Settings > Select Solution Wide runsettings File
  or on the command line by passing this file to "dotnet test" with the settings option.

  Two groups are excluded:

  1. Tests of the Ghostscript / ImageMagick helpers themselves.
  2. Test classes that call CompareTool.CompareVisually (53 call sites, 15 classes).
     These are excluded whole-class, which also drops some tests in them that would
     have passed - accepted as the cheaper option over per-method filtering.

  CompareToolTest is filtered per-method instead of whole-class, because it also holds
  the producer-line assertions (DifferentProducerTest, VersionReplaceTest) that must
  keep running.

  SystemUtilTest is likewise filtered per-method. Its two RunProcessAnd* tests read the
  ImageMagick path straight from the environment variable and hand it to the process
  starter, so with the variable unset they throw ArgumentNullException on a null
  executable. The other eight methods are pure string-splitting tests and still run.

  KNOWN LIMITATION - this filter cannot fix it:
  CompareTool.CompareByContent falls back to CompareVisuallyAndCombineReports
  (CompareTool.cs:2062) whenever it finds a difference, which invokes Ghostscript and
  throws GS_ENVIRONMENT_VARIABLE_IS_NOT_SPECIFIED. Passing content comparisons are
  unaffected, but a FAILING one reports a Ghostscript error instead of the real diff.
  A green run is trustworthy; a red one needs Ghostscript installed to be diagnosed.
-->
<RunSettings>
  <RunConfiguration>
    <TestCaseFilter>FullyQualifiedName!~GhostscriptHelperTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~GhostScriptHelperUnitTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~ImageMagickHelperTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~ImageMagickHelperUnitTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~AnnotationsSigningTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~Pdf20SigningTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~PdfASigningTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~PdfMergerTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~PolygonSvgNodeRendererTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~PolylineSvgNodeRendererTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~.RotationTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~SignDeferredTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~SignatureAppearanceTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~SignatureFieldAppearanceTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~SignedAppearanceTextTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~SimpleSigningTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~TaggedPdfSigningTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~WebPIntegrationTest&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~CompareToolTest.Gs&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~CompareToolTest.CompareCommand&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~CompareToolTest.CompareVisually&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~CompareToolTest.CompareToolErrorReport&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~CompareToolTest.BaseFontAbsence&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~CompareToolTest.DumpMemory&amp;FullyQualifiedName!~SystemUtilTest.RunProcessAnd</TestCaseFilter>
  </RunConfiguration>
</RunSettings>
